{"path":"numeric/fenv/feclearexcept","title":"feclearexcept","titleHtml":"feclearexcept","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/numeric/fenv/feclearexcept","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Attempts to clear the floating-point exceptions that are listed in the bitmask argument excepts, which is a bitwise OR of the floating-point exception macros.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv\"><code>&lt;fenv.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> feclearexcept<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> excepts <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Attempts to clear the floating-point exceptions that are listed in the bitmask argument <code>excepts</code>, which is a bitwise OR of the <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\">floating-point exception macros</a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  excepts\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  bitmask listing the exception flags to clear\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> if all indicated exceptions were successfully cleared or if <code>excepts</code> is zero. Returns a non-zero value on error.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fenv.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;math.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;float.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"coMULTI\">/*\n * A possible implementation of hypot which makes use of many advanced\n * floating-point features.\n */</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">double</span> hypot_demo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span> a, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> b<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> range_problem <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\"><span class=\"kw732\">FE_OVERFLOW</span></a> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\"><span class=\"kw733\">FE_UNDERFLOW</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  feclearexcept<span class=\"br0\">(</span>range_problem<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// try a fast algorithm</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> result <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/sqrt\"><span class=\"kw665\">sqrt</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> a <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> b <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> b<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/fetestexcept\"><span class=\"kw718\">fetestexcept</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>range_problem<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// no overflow or underflow</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> result<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>                   <span class=\"co1\">// return the fast result</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// do a more complicated calculation to avoid overflow or underflow</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> a_exponent,b_exponent<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/frexp\"><span class=\"kw696\">frexp</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a, <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>a_exponent<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/frexp\"><span class=\"kw696\">frexp</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>b, <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>b_exponent<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>a_exponent <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> b_exponent <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <a href=\"/w/c/types/limits\"><span class=\"kw396\">DBL_MAX_EXP</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/fabs\"><span class=\"kw644\">fabs</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/fabs\"><span class=\"kw644\">fabs</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>b<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>        <span class=\"co1\">// we can ignore the smaller value</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// scale so that fabs(a) is near 1</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> a_scaled <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/scalbn\"><span class=\"kw699\">scalbn</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span>a_exponent<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> b_scaled <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/scalbn\"><span class=\"kw699\">scalbn</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>b, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span>a_exponent<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// overflow and underflow is now impossible </span>\n  result <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/sqrt\"><span class=\"kw665\">sqrt</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a_scaled <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> a_scaled <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> b_scaled <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> b_scaled<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// undo scaling</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/scalbn\"><span class=\"kw699\">scalbn</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>result, a_exponent<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// Normal case takes the fast route</span>\n  <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"hypot(%f,&nbsp;%f) =&nbsp;%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">3.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">4.0</span>, hypot_demo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">3.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">4.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// Extreme case takes the slow but more accurate route</span>\n  <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"hypot(%e,&nbsp;%e) =&nbsp;%e<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, <a href=\"/w/c/types/limits\"><span class=\"kw378\">DBL_MAX</span></a> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span>, \n                                <a href=\"/w/c/types/limits\"><span class=\"kw378\">DBL_MAX</span></a> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span>, \n                                hypot_demo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/types/limits\"><span class=\"kw378\">DBL_MAX</span></a> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span>, <a href=\"/w/c/types/limits\"><span class=\"kw378\">DBL_MAX</span></a> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>hypot(3.000000, 4.000000) = 5.000000\nhypot(8.988466e+307, 8.988466e+307) = 1.271161e+308</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.6.2.1 The feclearexcept function (p: 209)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.6.2.1 The feclearexcept function (p: 190)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/fetestexcept\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fetestexcept</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   determines which of the specified floating-point status flags are set <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/fenv/feclearexcept\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>feclearexcept</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table></div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics"},{"path":"numeric/fenv","title":"Floating-point environment"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"feclearexcept","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Attempts to clear the floating-point exceptions that are listed in the bitmask argument excepts, which is a bitwise OR…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"excepts"},{"label":"Return value","note":"0 if all indicated exceptions were successfully cleared or if excepts is zero. Returns a non-zero value on error."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"fetestexcept","note":"determines which of the specified floating-point status flags are set"}]}]},"standards":["C99"],"wordCount":305,"codeBlockCount":2}
